  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "Kat，tháu放"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>顏月華</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「豬m̄大，大tuì狗去」，讀國校ê時，逐擺若是領著獎狀，提tńg去厝hōo阿母看，ǹg望伊ē-tàng kā我褒--兩-句-仔，伊kan-na ē應我tsit句話，m̄ bat kā我呵咾--過，mā無半句鼓勵ê話語。後--來，無論是參加比賽tio̍h等，iah是出業ê時領著議長獎、市長獎，所有ê一切kánn-ná lóng參我無啥tī代，提--tńg-去ê獎狀lóng恬恬仔囥tī屜仔底，bē輸是別人ê。「豬m̄大……」tsit句話tī我ê心肝底，沓沓仔釘根，有時tsūn，親像一枝針leh ui，一tsūn一tsūn疼tī心內，suah無法度háu出聲，因為我真認命，siáng叫我出世做查某囡仔。Tsit句話mā tsiânn做一个kat，無聲無sueh，縛tī心肝頭。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮阿爸是遠洋漁船ê船長，船仔便若入港，船公司ê總經理就ē紮蘋果來阮厝--裡行踏。鼻著hit籃芳kòng-kòng ê蘋果，阮三个姊妹仔kan-na ē-tàng tī邊--a流喙瀾，阮lóng知影he是beh留hōo阿兄食--ê，一半擺仔若有thang pun著薄薄--à一周thang食，就歡喜kah m̄知人。阿兄ê身體tsiânn lám，不時leh tsông病院、食刀仔肉。伊便若蹛院，阿母就ài kā纏tuè-tiâu--leh，厝內賰大姊leh看顧，所以阮自五、六年仔ê時就ē-hiáu煮食、款內底--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「阿母，阮老師問我講： “你ê成績tsiah-nī好，哪m̄去考大學？”」伊講：「查某囡仔飼大漢就別人ê，讀hiah濟冊beh創啥？無彩錢！」Hit當時阮阿爸tài著尿毒，tiānn-tiānn ài去病院洗腰子，大姊已經嫁--人--ah，兄哥去做兵。我真認份，恬恬仔tuè tī阿母身邊，開麵店仔做生理，維持一家大大細細ê生活。想著小弟、小妹iáu hiah細漢，我m̄ bat koh開喙討beh去讀冊。心肝頭ê hit个kat，suah ná來ná ân。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">結婚了後，m̄-nā ài kā翁婿ê事業tàu huānn siàu，koh ài tshiânn三个囡仔，不時iáu tio̍h照顧破病ê阿公、阿媽，逐日親像干樂kho̍k-kho̍k-gô，gô kah囡仔lóng大漢、離跤手--ah，坐bē tiâu ê我，揣著一个頭路，繼續gô。Tī職場tsiah知家己ê學歷siunn低，beh去讀冊ê想法koh再浮--出-來。Tsit擺我beh家己主意，我beh來去讀冊，就án-ne，koh做一擺學生。讀二專hit兩冬是我上快樂ê時tsūn，愛讀冊ê我，tsiok認真--ê，出業ê時是全班第二名--neh！科主任ài我留落來繼續讀，koh beh kā我tàu紹介貿易公司ê頭路。無疑悟，翁婿一句『女子無才便是德』koh kā我讀冊ê夢拍精神。心肝內ê hit个結，ta̋nn tsiah beh tháu--開niā-niā，又koh tsiânn做一个死kat--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">因為學歷無夠kuân，工作當中真濟好ê機會suah拍ka-la̍uh--去，我mā因為án-ne愈來愈自卑。兩年後翁婿得著癌症，陪伴伊行過四冬抗癌ê日子，看伊一个好好人，hōo癌細胞一喙一喙拆食落腹，留--落-來--ê是bē赴完成ê心願kap滿腹ê m̄甘願。Koh過三冬外，hām我上親ê小弟，因為一場公安意外，雄雄過身。人生ê風風雨雨kā我拍清醒，我知影：行--過ê路，m̄-thang越頭看；想beh做ê代誌m̄好koh躊躇。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">2021年ê年初，無意中看著社大有開台語課，lóng無tùn-tenn，就隨去報名。年尾通過認證，koh再參加培訓，順利提著教支人員ê資格。有一日，為著beh慶祝我領著證書，大漢查某囝tshuā我kap阿母去食好料--ê。食到一半，阿母無張無持kā我講：「Khah早lín公kap lín媽無thang hōo阮tsia-ê查某--ê去讀冊，一日到暗，kan-na叫阮ài作穡，我就是學lín公kap lín媽--ê，tsiah ē m̄ hōo你去讀冊……」「阿母--啊！我無怪--你--lah！Lín hit个年代ê查某囡仔phīng阮khah歹命，我看tsiok開--ê，你m̄-thang烏白想--lah！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心肝頭ê hit个結，雄雄tháu--開，鬱tī心內ê不平kap怨tsheh，就án-ne放hōo風飛--去。Kám知影suà--落-來我beh按怎？Tio̍h！我beh koh享受揹冊包仔去讀冊ê趣味--looh！&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEghXXRLgKj_kjRGhifVnrKVRjwL0KpLScEzwjSifUm_RJ59voh0N7PrTlyCpo5vJLSJhknS648lJrOGaxLs7XsOyqKWjPPUMz6J4RoRyjlA_GI73SPqoOLsq-Mz5wghm1nfibnvNRlFKTUQG8kiCafC1KBR6DrxX6N9smtThcVH7KH5UXDY6bG-BxO-fw/s1421/345%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEghXXRLgKj_kjRGhifVnrKVRjwL0KpLScEzwjSifUm_RJ59voh0N7PrTlyCpo5vJLSJhknS648lJrOGaxLs7XsOyqKWjPPUMz6J4RoRyjlA_GI73SPqoOLsq-Mz5wghm1nfibnvNRlFKTUQG8kiCafC1KBR6DrxX6N9smtThcVH7KH5UXDY6bG-BxO-fw/w450-h640/345%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjD4xiTOINQg0Yro5OqanEu20XGCtcPS7hnzuZ9LWt0Z3lm0K9X49Mg1AfByydSIibFgOo2gAqnecPT2pvHUDme4i7xIf-If3u3BceFR0aW5DZ5iZttYs7_CT7SXqRD6UMx9cHqg1vpMHZpgNh0Gyhfe8HOs-DO6QNyWEoI3hVohDN-TFXbtxb5gYme1g/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1345%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%8126.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjD4xiTOINQg0Yro5OqanEu20XGCtcPS7hnzuZ9LWt0Z3lm0K9X49Mg1AfByydSIibFgOo2gAqnecPT2pvHUDme4i7xIf-If3u3BceFR0aW5DZ5iZttYs7_CT7SXqRD6UMx9cHqg1vpMHZpgNh0Gyhfe8HOs-DO6QNyWEoI3hVohDN-TFXbtxb5gYme1g/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1345%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%8126.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj4KNHFjyDxzyfjr-UQZthpuggyERmkOUm9V2gSjXDhbjTAuNXDnbaoztL1GXU8-14x3qVYV2TO5IoWrsOIq2OgX1xdSVQKbWhMMf9N0UT8K-pD-UWajxYZoioVCxawVueqLX1hAvolj9i5yrueyjRONpO9_-21Y55pNcxe-bdAEvLvJ3Vu-Otb7oSr9w/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1345%E6%9C%9F_025.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj4KNHFjyDxzyfjr-UQZthpuggyERmkOUm9V2gSjXDhbjTAuNXDnbaoztL1GXU8-14x3qVYV2TO5IoWrsOIq2OgX1xdSVQKbWhMMf9N0UT8K-pD-UWajxYZoioVCxawVueqLX1hAvolj9i5yrueyjRONpO9_-21Y55pNcxe-bdAEvLvJ3Vu-Otb7oSr9w/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1345%E6%9C%9F_025.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>心內話&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap<b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>台羅</span></b>。<br /><br /></span></b></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> 345期，2022年12月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\" style=\"background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">#李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
